# Spectral AI — AWS Bedrock Sovereign Layer

## Architecture: Single Bedrock Client

All Claude inference routes through ONE file. Never import `@anthropic-ai/sdk` or
instantiate a BedrockRuntimeClient outside `lib/claude/bedrock.ts`.

```
lib/claude/bedrock.ts        ← ONLY Bedrock client. callBedrock() + callBedrockMultiTurn()
lib/claude/client.ts         ← querySpectral() wrapper — calls callBedrock() internally
lib/pcm/spectralRefApi.ts    ← SPECTRAL-REF narrator — calls callBedrock() internally
app/api/aerocopilot/route.ts ← AeroCopilot route — calls callBedrock() directly
```

## callBedrock() — Primary API

```ts
// lib/claude/bedrock.ts
export async function callBedrock(params: {
  system: string
  userContent: string
  maxTokens?: number       // default: 2048
  temperature?: number     // default: 0.3
}): Promise<string>

export async function callBedrockMultiTurn(params: {
  system: string
  messages: Array<{ role: 'user' | 'assistant'; content: string }>
  maxTokens?: number
  temperature?: number
}): Promise<string>
```

## Model & Region

```
Model ID : BEDROCK_MODEL_ID env var
           → ap.anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6-20250514-v1:0  (verify in AWS Console)
Region   : ap-southeast-2 — Geo cross-region routing (AU/NZ AP geography)
Transport: ConverseCommand via @aws-sdk/client-bedrock-runtime
```

## querySpectral() — Intelligence Analysis Wrapper

```ts
// lib/claude/client.ts — correct call signature
export interface SpectralQuery {
  question: string
  context: {
    platforms?:     object[]   // platforms table rows — OSINT fields only, NO Pk values
    jammers?:       object[]
    defeatSystems?: object[]
    incidents?:     object[]
  }
}
export async function querySpectral({ question, context }: SpectralQuery): Promise<string>
```

**CRITICAL:** The context type does NOT include Pk values, ERP data, or waveform profiles.
Never extend SpectralQuery to carry accredited data — that isolation is structural.

## AeroCopilot Pattern (POST /api/aerocopilot)

```ts
const text = await callBedrock({
  system: AEROCOPILOT_SYSTEM,     // lib/spectrum/aerocopilot-llm.ts
  userContent: buildCopilotUserMessage(query, platforms, radars, effectors),
  maxTokens: 1200,
  temperature: 0.3,
})
const parsed = parseCopilotResponse(text)  // safe JSON parse with null fallback
```

## SPECTRAL-REF Pattern (PCM narrator only)

```ts
// lib/pcm/spectralRefApi.ts
// REF is a narrator. It does NOT resolve combat. Narrate and coach only.
const raw = await callBedrock({
  system: buildRefSystemPrompt(),
  userContent: buildRefUserMessage(worldState, redOrders, blueOrders),
  maxTokens: 4096,
  temperature: 0.3,
})
return parseRefRaw(raw)   // safe fallback: { ds_briefing: 'REF narrative parse error...' }
```

**buildRefUserMessage() must NEVER include:** raw Pk values, ERP/waveform data,
AccreditedDataLayer content. Message contains: turn/phase/contact counts/magazine remaining/
platform counts/inject queue/order summaries ONLY.

